an><span class="path14"></span></i></button></div></div></div></div></div><div id="basic-text-2" class="component xxl:mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-xl md:mb-desktop-spacing-padding-lg sm:mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-lg mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-xl component [&amp;:has(.empty-component)]:!mb-0 component !mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-md sm:!mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-md lg:!mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-md"><div class="analytics-event-listener contents"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 w-full component [&amp;.component_&amp;]:p-0 h-full mx-auto max-w-screen-xxl px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16" data-qa-id="BasicText-BasicText"><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-8 md:col-start-3"><div id="Goodyear Accessibility Statement" class="w-full flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-[var(--breakpoint-container-max-width)] mx-auto text-black"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h1 class="heading-xl text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Goodyear Accessibility Statement</h1><hr aria-hidden="true" class="Divider-module-scss-module__jL2KVW__divider Divider-module-scss-module__jL2KVW__divider--light !my-4 sm:!my-6"></div><div class=" last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Goodyear is committed to digital accessibility conforming to the <a href="https://www.levelaccess.com/blog/web-content-accessibility-guidelines-wcag/" type="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:rich-text:link&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;exit&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;https://www.levelaccess.com/blog/web-content-accessibility-guidelines-wcag/&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;basic-text|rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG)2.1</a>, Level AA and complying with the Department of Justice's <a href="https://www.ada.gov/2010_regs.htm" type="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:rich-text:link&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;exit&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;https://www.ada.gov/2010_regs.htm&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;basic-text|rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a> Standards for Accessible Design, and other applicable regulations.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">To accomplish this, we have partnered with LEVEL Access to administer our accessibility program and oversee its governance. Their accessibility program evaluates our digital products on an ongoing basis in accordance with best practices. It is supported by a diverse team of accessibility professionals, including users of assistive technologies. The platform, moreover, goes beyond minimum compliance requirements by making an<a href="https://www.levelaccess.com/a/goodyear" type="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:rich-text:link&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;exit&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;https://www.levelaccess.com/a/goodyear&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;basic-text|rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0"> assistive CX technology application</a> available to customers who have trouble typing, gesturing, moving a mouse, or reading.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">If you wish to discuss potential accommodations related to using this website, please contact our Accessibility Manager at <a href="tel:+1800-321-2136" type="button" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:rich-text:link&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;exit&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;tel:+1800-321-2136&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;basic-text|rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0">800-321-2136</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer id="global-footer"><div cl